bladditions.research.goinghome.title=Going Home
bladditions.research.goinghome.0=After traversing the wonders of this realm and those beyond, I sense it's time to return home. Though armed with the blueprints for a device to carry me back, assembling it poses its own challenges, especially given the scarcity of certain materials.<BR><BR>One essential metal eludes me in this world, yet I've stumbled upon ancient, corroded machines harboring a metal akin to what I need. To repurpose these components, a bloomery of far greater heat is required. Fortunately, the advanced technology I've garnered here offers hope of restoring the metal to its former glory, paving the way for my journey homeward.
bladditions.research.goinghome.1=True to my anticipations, I've crafted a bloomery far surpassing the old in efficiency and heat. Perhaps the incorporation of void material was an extravagance rather than a necessity. Yet, a compelling force within me couldn't shy away from this venture, suggesting that, on some level, this path was meant to be taken...
